<!doctype html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{ title or "Thermo Concept Engineering" }}</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/css/style.css' | url }}">
</head>
<body>
  {# Header: node 157:3721 (десктоп/планшет + мобильное бургер-меню).
     Порядок повторяющихся секций на каждой странице (Home, node
     405:2033): Hero → Divider(edge) → Brands → Divider → CTA →
     Divider(edge-secondary) → Footer. "Edge"-дивайдеры видны только
     с 1000px, обычный — на всех брейкпоинтах. Brands: node 462:2019.
     CTA: node 416:1812. Footer: node 157:3735 #}
  {% include "header.njk" %}
  <main>
    {{ content | safe }}
  </main>
  {% set dividerVariant = "edge" %}
  {% include "divider.njk" %}
  {% set dividerVariant = "" %}
  {% include "brands.njk" %}
  {% include "divider.njk" %}
  {% include "cta.njk" %}
  {% set dividerVariant = "edge-secondary" %}
  {% include "divider.njk" %}
  {% set dividerVariant = "" %}
  {% include "footer.njk" %}
  <script src="{{ '/js/header.js' | url }}" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
